---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updated = 'June 15, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How FullTVBox handles your data — what we collect, what we don't, the third parties involved, and your rights under the GDPR."
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-14">
    <span class="label text-signal">// Legal — Data &amp; Privacy</span>
    <h1 class="font-display font-900 text-4xl sm:text-5xl tracking-tight mt-1 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="label text-dim mb-8">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="smpte-bars h-1 w-full mb-10 opacity-60"></div>

    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none prose-bench
      prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:text-ink
      prose-p:text-ink/85 prose-li:text-ink/85">

      <p>
        FullTVBox ("we", "us") is an independent review site. We believe a privacy policy should
        describe what actually happens — so here is the short, honest version: <strong>we do not
        run analytics, advertising trackers, or third-party cookies, and we do not ask you to log
        in or hand over personal information.</strong> The detail below explains the limited data
        that is unavoidably processed when you visit any website.
      </p>

      <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
      <p>
        FullTVBox is the data controller for this site. For any privacy question or to exercise
        the rights described below, contact us at{' '}
        <a href="mailto:privacy@fulltvbox.com">privacy@fulltvbox.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
      <p>
        We do not set any cookies, and we do not use local or session storage to track you. There
        is no analytics script, no advertising pixel, and no consent banner — because there is
        nothing to consent to. Our on-site search runs entirely in your browser and sends no
        queries to us or anyone else.
      </p>

      <h2>What is processed when you visit</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Server / hosting logs.</strong> Our host (Cloudflare Pages) automatically
          processes technical data such as your IP address, browser type, and the pages requested.
          This is standard for any web server and is used only to deliver the site and protect it
          from abuse. The legal basis is our legitimate interest in operating a secure website
          (GDPR Article 6(1)(f)).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Fonts and assets.</strong> All fonts and images are served from our own domain.
          We do <em>not</em> load Google Fonts or other third-party assets, so your IP address is
          not shared with font or asset providers.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>
        Some product links are affiliate links (for example, the Amazon Associates programme). If
        you click one and make a purchase, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. When
        you follow such a link you leave FullTVBox and enter the retailer's own site, where that
        retailer may set its own cookies and process your data under <em>its</em> privacy policy —
        which we do not control. We never receive your payment details or personal information from
        these purchases; we only receive aggregate, anonymous commission reports.
      </p>

      <h2>Third parties we rely on</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — hosting and content delivery (processes request logs as described above).</li>
        <li><strong>Affiliate retailers</strong> (e.g. Amazon) — only when you click an outbound affiliate link.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Because our host operates a global network, technical data may be processed on servers
        outside your country, including outside the EEA. Such transfers rely on the provider's
        standard contractual clauses and equivalent safeguards.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights under the GDPR</h2>
      <p>
        If you are in the EU/EEA or UK, you have the right to access, correct, erase, restrict, or
        object to the processing of your personal data, and the right to data portability. As we
        hold no account or profile data about you, in practice the only data tied to you is
        transient server-log information. To make a request, or to lodge a complaint with your
        local data protection authority, email{' '}
        <a href="mailto:privacy@fulltvbox.com">privacy@fulltvbox.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        Server logs are retained only for as long as needed for security and operational purposes
        and are then deleted or anonymised. We keep no other personal data.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        FullTVBox is intended for a general audience and is not directed at children under 16. We
        do not knowingly collect personal data from children.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy as the site evolves — for example, if we ever introduce analytics
        or advertising. Material changes will be reflected in the "Last updated" date above, and any
        new data collection will be described here before it begins.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
